  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "# Changelog 0.0.188\n\n## Changes (initial history)\n\n- docs: add project overview (`aebaf21`)\n- docs: document staggered diagonal camera support (`de7ac23`)\n- feat(gb): stagger diagonal camera streaming (`5b88abd`)\n- fix(sdk): reject game boy diagonal camera requests (`22fb41a`)\n- docs(nes): document free-scroll streaming support (`f6a793c`)\n- feat(nes): complete four-screen free scroll streaming (`b446265`)\n- docs(nes): gate free-scroll streaming capabilities (`b7b0e31`)\n- feat(nes): add four-screen free scroll camera (`f99747a`)\n- docs(nes): add free 2-axis scroll roadmap (`684b42f`)\n- docs(camera): document diagonal scroll as recommended proof of concept (`4710526`)\n- feat(gb): validate vertical camera scroll (`a90a09e`)\n- feat: add animated runner Goomba actor (`7bedfdc`)\n- perf(actors): hoist camera-X projection per phase loop (`83ec07c`)\n- docs: close out AR-14 actor framework (AF-4.3) (`9bf9bf6`)\n- feat(actors): generated-name guards and codegen robustness (`f039845`)\n- feat(actors): metasprite-aware actor pool capability checks (`13bd16c`)\n- feat(actors): runtime camera-window actor activation (`d0a2d5b`)\n- feat(actors): per-actor camera-relative collision and contact (`52d8182`)\n- fix(codegen): make var-var compare/subtract reentrant under nesting (`740a18b`)\n- feat(actors): world-space actor positioning and camera-relative draw (`8761c09`)\n- docs: track actor framework review findings as Phase 5 (`72f1a02`)\n- feat(actors): scalable platformer actor framework over struct-array pools (`f222770`)\n- docs: add actor framework branch roadmap and task breakdown (`aa56296`)\n- feat(lang): byte-backed struct arrays with runtime-indexed field access (`cdc4ebd`)\n- fix: keep runner OAM writes in VBlank (`066aa17`)\n- docs: add scalable platformer actor roadmap (`4f2dc80`)\n- feat(gameboy): add transparent MBC1 banking foundation (`f710333`)\n- feat(gameboy): SDK-op stream foundation for transparent code banking (`2270ae5`)\n- fix(runner): B-run accelerates only with traction; fix backward scroll (`4f3f9b5`)\n- fix: make runner solid blocks block the player from below (`c01d437`)\n- fix: keep Game Boy music tempo locked to frames while scrolling (`b63b014`)\n- feat: transparent MBC1 banking for large and multiple Game Boy music (`7c9b4b8`)\n- feat: faithful + compact gbapu v2 music format (`76770b3`)\n- feat: add game boy apu trace music support (`3370c40`)\n- feat: enforce aggregate SDK frame budgets (`7b2be6c`)\n- fix: enforce integer initializer type diagnostics (`8f427a1`)\n- feat: unify runner source across targets (`8aec7c1`)\n- fix: color NES Tiled backgrounds (`11f08e2`)\n- fix: improve NES runner visuals and camera parity (`9e8657e`)\n- feat: add NES runner parity (`7e2a525`)\n- feat: add NES runner sample (`79742ff`)\n- test: cover world.load camera scroll path on both targets (`74bc30d`)\n- feat: land tiled world.load on nes from shared logical map (`4710c7c`)\n- refactor: share png decode and canonical tile quantization in core (`f350d8b`)\n- docs: record aggregate frame-budget enforcement decision for sdk (`26c936e`)\n- refactor: single-source dot-call receiver vs sdk precedence (`55b1f00`)\n- feat: infer integer width suffix for let and const (`3e48b00`)\n- refactor: extract neutral tiled map model from game boy importer (`8ba2c3b`)\n- fix: validate flag queries and constant initializers (`f3928d9`)\n- feat: add logical palette declarations (`2f890b9`)\n",
